OL,5,G1900 The Box
OL,6,     FFour celebrities remain and with a
OL,7,     Fplace in the final within reach,
OL,8,     Feveryone has their eye on victory.
OL,9,     FWhile no one can predict where the
OL,10,     Fbox doors will open next - one
OL,11,     Fcelebrity is brimming with
OL,12,     Fconfidence, while another is
OL,13,     Foffered a chance to take revenge.
