OL,15,     Fthem into increasingly bizarre
OL,16,     Fworlds, and this time unsuspecting
OL,17,     Fmembers of the public become part
OL,18,     Fof the game. One more celebrity
OL,19,     Fface elimination and with that,
OL,20,     Fthe three finalists are revealed
